# Acme Corp Internal Product Roadmap FY26
**Classification:** Restricted — Internal Only
**Owner:** Product Management
**Date:** January 2026
**Status:** Approved for internal distribution

---

## FY26 Product Vision

Acme Corp's FY26 product roadmap focuses on three strategic pillars:
1. **AI-Native Workflows**: Deep integration of AI assistance into every workflow
2. **Enterprise Governance**: Enhanced security, compliance, and audit capabilities
3. **Platform Ecosystem**: Third-party integrations and API extensibility

## Q1 FY26 Deliverables (Completed)

- ✅ AI assistant v2.0 with improved context retention
- ✅ SSO/SAML improvements for enterprise customers
- ✅ Webhook API v2 (breaking change from v1)
- ✅ Mobile app iOS improvements

## Q2 FY26 Deliverables (In Progress)

- 🔄 Knowledge base enterprise search (ETA: May 2026)
- 🔄 Bulk data export API (ETA: June 2026)
- 🔄 Audit log UI and export (ETA: April 2026)
- 🔄 EU data residency option (ETA: June 2026)

## Q3–Q4 FY26 Planned

- Multi-tenant workspace isolation improvements
- AI model provider selection (Claude / OpenAI)
- Advanced analytics dashboard
- GitHub and Confluence connectors
- SOC 2 Type II renewal

## Key Dependencies and Risks

- EU data residency requires infrastructure work in AWS eu-west-1 region
- AI model provider selection depends on partner agreements under negotiation
- Analytics dashboard depends on data warehouse migration (technical debt item)

